swords come from app settings (DB_URL, STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING, …), never from code." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1B1B1B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="740" y="1000" width="820" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
